# Astral Chain [01007300020FA000] v1.0.1 - Dynamic-60fps v1.1.1 (60 fps cap)
# v1.0 + two fixes for high frame rates:
#  - Action and input timers (move input windows, double-tap windows, action delays) count whole 30 FPS frames.
#  - Camera smoothing uses the frame time instead of a fixed fraction per frame.
# Disable the Static mods and the "Cutscenes Speed Fix For 60 FPS Patch" cheat.

@flag offset_shift 0x100
# Dynamic FPS v1.1.1 - Dynamic-60fps
@enabled
